{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_17_level_st_17-04","groupId":"main_17","stageId":"st_17-04","title":"在暗夜中燃烧","storyCode":"17-21","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_17-04.txt","sourceHash":"3fea9ada546e6adf0b951ccce5e75c8ac65115887e3e75c5527bb66821eaeb71","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"整合运动与米拉娜正式达成合作，与此同时，整合运动在后方的农庄遭到了乌萨斯军队的袭击。费奥多尔挖出空棺材，克利姆埋葬了妻子的遗体，凯尔希舍弃永恒的生命，归还了代码以彻底封闭和稳定石棺。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你慷慨的邀请，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，整合运动的农庄要一下子接收那么多矿工，以及愿意追随我们的居民，不是一件轻松的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也能理解，对于你们来说，接纳一些非感染者，同样困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过请你相信，我们都是劳动的好手。只要有一丝安稳的地方就能自给自足，顺便照顾好有需要的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我毫不担心你们，在泽尔格勒我已经见识过这支队伍的韧性，图林——应该说，米拉娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我还需要一段时间才能彻底改口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该道歉的是我，我不自量力的自称让大家误会了那么久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你让我来这里单独谈谈，是打算......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聊聊接下来要做的事......我们的将来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经在野外与帝国军队分散周旋，并坚信这是对抗帝国最好的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但当时的我们稚嫩而松散，有的人失去了本心，有的人走向了歧途......他们大多数已经死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来，我获得了一段相对平静的日子......那时我在思考，如果我们能变得更团结，能动员更多的人，能不断提醒自己真正的理想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能让所有感染者......不，让所有乌萨斯同胞，都相信自己可以拥有更美好的未来，让大家有共同的理想，也许会有不一样的结果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经找到要打倒的敌人，接下来，应该去找更多可以同行的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很高兴听到这些话，可也不禁有点遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，图林没能见过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很惭愧，米拉娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听柳德米拉说了不少你的故事......我们走过相似的路，见证过同样的苦难，可你做得远比我要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你从不曾被绝望打败过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不是很明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动的成员不都是坚强的战士，一路战斗到了现在？你为什么要说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等将来有机会，我再把这个故事讲给你听吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，米拉娜，你愿意继续走向反抗这个国家一切不公的道路的话......请让我们并肩而行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的荣幸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"青年主动上前了一步，握住塔露拉的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我只知道你的名字，而你的队伍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有名字......我们实在无暇思考这类问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不过如果你同意，我希望以整合运动的名号行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你不要误会，我并不是永远喜欢借用别人的名号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是担心......整合运动犯过许多错，或许这个名号会让一些人误会你的立场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，还记得吗？我和你说过，只是听到你们的故事，最沮丧的矿工都能重燃希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就连在泽尔格勒，这种富庶的南方城市，也依然有人会借用这个名字行动，试图去发出喊声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_2225_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果说在乌萨斯有什么名号，能让受苦的人们振奋、让施虐的人们胆寒，那一定是整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，终于找到你了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请稍等，我们的事情还没有谈完。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"实在抱歉，但我必须立刻告诉你，刚才从南边传来了急报——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的农庄出事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g13_reunionfarm"},{"type":"narration","text":"阴暗的天空下，正燃起熊熊火光。\n谷仓的屋顶先飞了起来，木头还没落地，另一发炮弹便犁过了牲口棚，掀翻了井边的木桶......\n遥远的山坡上，无数炮口的火焰明明灭灭，像有人一下一下地划着火柴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人炮击！迅速避让——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"喊声未落，又一轮炮弹砸进场地。木屑与泥土纷扬落下，驮兽的嘶鸣混着孩子的哭声，撕开了他们宁静已久的日子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这到底......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要慌乱，想想你该做的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你来了，九！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_1983_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经带了增援过来，也安排了协助疏散的人手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_1983_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再去检查一遍还有没有行动不便的人，把他们都背出来，然后立马撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_1983_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论来者是谁，都由我们来抵挡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_1983_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分抱歉，布乌卡先生，请您暂时远离我们，跟上撤离的队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_1983_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是对您最安全的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，九女士，为了，啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我们、我们愿意继续交流、贸易，如果你们能够——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_1983_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来人，带布乌卡先生离开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好好，我这就走，这就走......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"九和她身后的整合运动勇士们来到了农庄的中间，仰望沿着山坡冲下的、乌泱泱的步兵队伍。\n在她身前，涌出的花海如血海，向敌人奔去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_campsite_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通信兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告长官！我们刚才陆续收到了两份电报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通信兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一份，他们转交了卡西米尔人的抗议，交火地点位于乌卡边境，已经有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，不用理会卡西米尔人，念第二封。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......第二封来自指挥中心，还在养伤的元帅对您的进展十分满意，希望能早日看到乌萨斯的旗帜飘扬在叛国贼的据点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，早该如此了......帮我回复他们，我们不但会插上乌萨斯的旗帜，还会插上第一集团军的旗帜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会让所有乌萨斯人看到，谁才是这片土地上，最光荣的军队。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最光荣的军队......吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g17_exurbforest_in"},{"type":"narration","text":"我知道，父亲与母亲没有合葬。\n父亲埋在皇家陵园，母亲却葬在夏季行宫的苹果林中。果林的尽头，有一座小小的墓园。\n......难道我刻意不去想起这点，就能将这事实抹除了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......不是苹果林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下，这也是我一直想说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是先皇在位时期，夏季行宫中原有的果林在经历一次大规模的锈病爆发后，就被铲除干净，换上其他树种了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那甚至远在您出生之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那旁边的墓碑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是谁的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在您决定过来之前，我做了调查，发现宫内没有记载。实地来看，墓碑的尺寸也小了很多，显然不是皇室墓葬的规格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照习俗，下面埋着的也可能是她生前喜爱的宠物——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。即使是宠物也会有名字，那个墓碑上，没有名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"墓碑上有的，只是一句碑铭。\n“为我永远的爱。我将她的灵魂，安葬在此。”\n墓园中，小小的、简单的墓碑，靠在华丽的皇室墓碑旁边，就像孩子依偎着母亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把它挖出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，让人把这个墓碑下的棺材挖出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论您想证实什么，那都只是赝品，只能是赝品。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g14_prolocutoroffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自称为“皇女”的不明身份者，突然出现在布列斯克，背后明显有女大公的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是根据她初次出现在城中安抚民众时的情况就能判断的。但唯有一件事，令我们的情报人员无论如何都想不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位“皇女”没有任何掩盖真实面容的迹象，可据在场所有目击者回忆，她的脸......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一向敢于直言的侍从，在这时突然停顿，抬头观察着皇帝的神情，似乎不确定自己是否应该说出接下来的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她的脸，和画像上的先皇后，几乎一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在布列斯克，甚至在整个远北地区，几乎每户人家的客厅角落，被称为“红角”的地方，都会摆放一份先皇与先皇后的画像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只需要看到她，听到她的声音，再有那些“天降”的馈赠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位“皇女”的虚假称号传到圣骏堡，也只是早晚的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g17_exurbforest_in"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯没有皇女，先皇没有其他的孩子。您必须比任何人都坚信这点，否则，我们所做的一切都将前功尽弃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要让我再说一次了，维特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就只是，为我打开它吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g17_exurbforest_in"},{"type":"narration","text":"棺材并未埋得很深，挖出它，再将它抬上来，甚至都不用两个人来做。\n问题出现在打开之后。只装得下宠物，或是几岁孩子的遗体的棺材，其中空无一物。\n没有尸骨，也没有遗物。\n什么也没有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"皇帝走上前，在棺材前单膝跪下，伸出手去，在上面摩挲着。\n终于，他找到了一个刻在棺材上的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“纳斯塔霞·弗拉基米洛夫娜·拉齐萨拉”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"纳斯塔霞。\n姐姐。\n纳斯佳。\n他抬头，望着并非苹果树的树木生长出的黄绿相间的枝叶。\n如果死者并非死者，如果鲜明的记忆也可以是错误的，如果已经遗忘的都能够被找回，那么......\n还有什么是不可能的呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......就这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“两米长，一点五米宽和一点五米深。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人一生需要的土地，果然只有这么大啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有棺材，却可以放下一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也只能放下一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我多想......就这样留下来陪你。再挖出一块这样的坑洞，躺进去，闭上眼睛，永远陪着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不能。我现在知道拉达在哪儿了，我必须跟着那些人，去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了。我还没来得及告诉你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我在我们的通讯频段里，听到了拉达的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉达长大了。但她什么都记得......记得我们给她念过的所有故事，她一下就听出来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多么聪明，多么......像你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你想回到切尔诺伯格，但我现在只能带你到这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我见到拉达，再带她，来见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候我们一起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g2_luo_reception"},{"type":"narration","text":"“......阿法纳西·伊戈里耶维奇·赫拉托夫上将，原第六集团军第一师团总司令，兼任参谋长。”\n“最初于四皇会战中崭露头角，在第十次乌卡战争中指挥少数精锐力量挫败了敌人反攻的企图，取得在同龄人中极为罕见的成就。”\n“后在边境冲突或局部摩擦中屡立战功，有相当丰富的正面战场、奇袭、镇压或调停行动的相关经验。”\n“在血峰战役失利之后，他痛定思痛，于‘大叛乱’时期带队脱离第六集团军向帝国议会投诚，为后期的反击战争取了关键时间......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干什么呢，将军？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是看看书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么书？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友归还的书。你感兴趣吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没有很感兴趣......我还记得你有本谁都不许动的线装书呢，这本看起来比那本还破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们记载了相似的内容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想看的话，可以把这本拿去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"话语间，赫拉格动作轻巧地抬起书本，向女孩展示封面的同时，悄无声息地把刚才阅读的页面从书上撕了下来，在掌中揉作一团。\n已经脆弱不堪的线装书，在他迅捷的动作中也只是颤抖了一下，并未直接散开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g1_sjbstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就当我是还没死心吧，将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情暂时告一段落，但后面还有更大的浪潮，正在滚滚而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须再问一次。即使这些日子里您看到了更多，却也仍然不愿回到我们当中吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果——如果是在一个崭新的乌萨斯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这都不是症结所在，阿洛伊泽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒绝，只是因为知道无论如何，这里都已经不再是我的归处了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，请您至少收下这本书吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我父亲......这是副议长书房中的收藏之一。他一直想要“物归原主”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也为了感谢您对我的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您那时挺身而出，赫拉格先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g2_luo_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《不息的行军》......？看上去是小说？还是军事史？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以有自己的解读。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它都快散架了。我真能借走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那行......谢啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，差点忘了正事。博士他们从泽尔格勒回来了，离开乌萨斯之前想在办事处简单聚一下，你来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我会到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外面的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你找谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外面的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直接进去问......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个在公民大会上出现的矿工，别乔克，现在是在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过你。你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_2248_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）其实我也是幸存的远北矿工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"avg_188_helage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g13_nobleroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又下雪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道圣骏堡又会有多少人冻毙于这场雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可无论如何，他们也不会因为你莽撞的行为而获救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该想到的，你向来是个骄傲的孩子，我也永远将你视作骄傲，阿洛达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那样地优秀，以至于我都忘了教给你一个最基本的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地本身拥有秩序，任何人都不能凭自己的意志去改变它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先皇失败了，我们如今的陛下，还有维特......等待他们的也只有失败。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是否要理解为，您乐于见到他们的失败？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而只有他们失败，您才能保护属于您的那一份利益。您拥护的秩序，究竟在保护谁的利益？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定是忘了，就是你嗤之以鼻的“得利者”，在保护你从远北带回的那些感染者，在保护你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您觉得这是一种施舍，而不是他们与生俱来的权利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一句除了正确一无所有的口号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......我一点也不正确，正确的是您才对——一个止步不前的人是永远不会犯错的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"维特议长他们会犯错，因为他们还在主动地做些什么，试图改变什么，试图阻止什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必将妥协绥靖说得那样睿智，停步不前从来不是一个困难的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你依然在试图用天真的论调去对抗现实......这是你习惯性会犯的错误，也是我的错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天我会送你出城。在这之前，你就先在这里冷静一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也反省一下自己莽撞的行动，究竟给家族、给你侍奉的君主，带去了怎样灾难性的后果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道你还认为我是从前那个只要一提到“禁闭”“反省”，就会吓得浑身发抖的孩子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你自己也知道，我早就不是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我选择回来，再见你一面，是因为我愿意。而现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然你执迷不悟，那有些事，就只能我去做了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦西里","speakerId":"avg_npc_2162_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——阿洛达！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_moon"},{"type":"narration","text":"晚风将撕破的窗帘吹起，窗栏上，留有脚印，和崭新的血迹。\n从破损的窗户看出去，双月高悬于天空，恒久如常。\n可下一刻，一些改变，令人惊讶的改变，悄然发生了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"被寒夜遮蔽的街道上，路灯逐渐亮了起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i20"},{"type":"narration","text":"先是路灯，紧接着，是居民室内的灯光。\n暖色的灯一盏盏亮起，逐渐铺满多数城区。像是被画满了亮色的涂色板，也像是被重新唤起的心跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈，有光了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"树上那些新年灯饰也亮起来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欣慰的市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傻孩子......不仅是这些灯光，听说连电暖也恢复了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欣慰的市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别跑来跑去了，面包也买到了，我们快回去看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这下就算下雪也不会冷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欣慰的市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算是化雪的时候，也不会再冷了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"熙攘的欢笑声，伴随着灯光的亮起，环绕在寒夜之中。\n只有那伟岸的琥珀宫，在黑暗中长久静默着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾丽塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克利姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_2242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完成了，你要做的事吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g9_reactor_s"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你确定要这么做吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们虽然暂时解决了石棺失控的危机，但想要将它作为一个稳定的能量源，还需要一些助力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"AMa-10的核心代码，可以作为管理程序永远存放在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从另一种角度讲，石棺很适合将“AMa-10”这个名字埋葬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"像是某种巧合。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"新的故事总是从这里开始的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，在过往的岁月里，我与这座石棺的联系颇多，我曾多次向这片大地上的文明掩盖这座石棺的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到上一次我选择信任他人......你知道的，那一次的结果并不理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，最后一次，与你一同封锁这座石棺时我说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他们真的能重新启动它......我愿意相信，它必定只会由善良之人的手重启。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些真正渴望改变这片大地的人，未来会在他们手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我们的确再次面临选择——与这片大地上所有文明共同合作，或是单打独斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认如今的选择像是绝望的押注，我无法从理性上判断，但我们的确已经没有时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是一味地保守......而是选择站在“希望”的这一边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"听上去你像是放下了一些担子。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从我听到的消息来看，你应该也做出了一样的选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可是这也意味着......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你不会再拥有下一次“生命”。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是很好吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_1052_kalts2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仅有一次的，能够真正作为“人”度过的一生，这何尝不是命运的馈赠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i24_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处的炮声停止了，硝烟渐渐散去，夕阳为脚下破碎的城市又披上了一层红。\n你们听到了多方军队暂且罢兵的消息，这意味着至少在当下，居住在这里的人得到了撤离的时间。\n于是，你们踏上归途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，从今往后石棺真的能稳定输出能源了？乌萨斯的能源危机可以有些缓解了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这下我们对圣骏堡也算有个交代了，这一行的任务，应该算是完美完成了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是得到了石棺的能源，恐怕也只够乌萨斯中央几座移动城市勉强渡过这个冬天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"长期来看，乌萨斯的处境还是很艰难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们只能期待，封存在这里的石棺，不会再次引发不必要的争端......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，凯尔希医生回来了，我们所有人都在。这一次任务很成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说得对！我们带回了凯尔希！这是罗德岛完完全全的胜利！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们做了自己能做的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"从结果来看，也不错。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你看向了走在后面的凯尔希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你还好吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我好像，想起了很久远的事，许多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"关于这座石棺，还有许多与它有关的人和事......直到现在，那些事情才能算有了一个结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有些记忆太遥远，它们好像正在从我的脑海中淡去，这是我之前从未有过的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"突然觉得，这样呼吸的感觉......很陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希！如果你还是感觉不太好，我可以抱着你，就和原来一样——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i24_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......谢谢，我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像现在这样......我应该会习惯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......像这样活着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i25_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我需要你尽快告知你要求我来这里的目的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"耐心一点。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"马上就到了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔为这次重逢准备了很久。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"希望能给你一个惊喜。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i25_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i15"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i16_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i25_2"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"欢迎回到罗德岛。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i25_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"被震惊到说不出话了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"的确比我想象的要壮观不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你们做到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就像你说的，罗德岛不会因为某人的离开而停下。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但我们也由衷地希望，每个人都不会离开。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i25_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里的装置......区域性源石静滞装置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是罗德岛最新的研究？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"花了不少功夫。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"为了防备上一次的意外再度发生。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"令人赞叹的结果......但是恐怕这还不足以与她完全对抗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们依然不知道她真正的目的......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i25_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我想到另一些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们在泽尔格勒的石棺控制程序中，找到了AMa-10的核心代码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然AMa-10在设计之初，的确拥有管理前文明诸多设备的权限，但是最终未能完全执行这一功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说......石棺中的代码，是她在苏醒后植入其中的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她为什么要这么做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一个合理的猜想，是她的下一步计划，指向了更多前文明留下的遗产。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道她具体的谋划，但我们有理由相信，如果她想要对如今的泰拉文明造成毁灭性的打击，她能做到的事远不止于此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们所经历的事情更加证实了，她对如今的泰拉，更像是持旁观的态度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"其实，在远北矿场，我听到了她的声音。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i06"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i25_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是文明自身，持续了万年的辩题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在，要做的事只有一件......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向她证明——如今的泰拉文明，有存续下去的可能，以及价值。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们选择接受这个邀请。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep17"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowfield_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希尔达......现在我们该去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多同伴都很害怕，在泽尔格勒经历了那么多可怕的事，大家都不是很好，我们是不是应该离开乌萨斯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信有什么苦难是理所应当的，那些被施加的痛苦，是我们应当竭尽全力去对抗的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去帮助受苦的人，去战胜施害的人......这才是我们应该去做的事。"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人将她的理想告诉了我，她向我描绘了这片大地的另一番样貌......人们可以跨过隔阂，这片大地可以成为所有人共同的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"苦难无法被终结，可是希望也同样会延续下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我们暂时不会离开乌萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里还有许多在忍受苦难的同胞等待解救，我们不能放弃他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼得！你怎么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些斑点！你，你也感染那种病了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绝望的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......咳咳......结果还是没躲过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绝望的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了......不要再管我了......反正都是死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧......我们不会抛下任何一个同伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"希尔达伸出手，一枚纯净的源石晶簇就这样凭空出现在她的手中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"接着，她将源石晶簇插入了感染者的心脏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绝望的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴尔斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希尔达！你这是做什么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鲜血从创口处喷涌而出，但那也仅仅是一瞬间的事。\n很快，源石覆盖了他的伤口，从伤口处向全身蔓延，他的身体从源石中长出了新的血肉。\n他的身躯焕然一新。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再绝望的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我好像，不再痛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再绝望的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......新生？"},{"type":"narration","text":"这是神迹！希尔达再一次向我们施展了神迹！\n人们欢呼着，在少女面前匍匐跪下。\n少女也跪了下来。她对着渺远的天空，双手握紧，做出祈祷的动作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神明啊......请告诉我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_2246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道痛苦，真的是这个世界上唯一的法则？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_RL2_cliffnight"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可怜的孩子......我又该如何告诉你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有精神上的痛苦，都来源于对现实错误的认知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可这是个体生命与这个宇宙之间永恒的鸿沟，也是文明必经的歧路，没有人可以超脱其外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，不会太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会为你们带来答案。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她沐浴在双月皎洁的光辉下，将目光投向了大海的深处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i26"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]}]}
